{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.QBeta.StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.QBeta.StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Init.Data.Nat.Basic","lean:module:Init.Data.Int.Basic","lean:module:Init.Omega"],"declarations":18,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.qou_counts_miss_dt_count","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.qou_counts_miss_dt_count","kind":"theorem","line":168,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.lean#L168-L178","doc":"**Summary (formalize-first honest negative).** Neither the QOU\nEuler-characteristic machinery (`partitionEuler3 = −2`) nor the internally-derived\nrecursion order (`recursionOrder 4₁ = 2`) reproduces the knot DT count\n(`dtCount 4₁ = 3`): `−2 ≠ 3` and `2 < 3`. The bridge's first equality\n`Stokes = DT` for the knot is therefore **not** derivable from the assumed-QOU\nWedderburn/Springer structure — it requires the geometric spectral-curve DT count\n(the character-variety Behrend/BPS invariant), which is external. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.dtOffDiag_gt_recursionOrder","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.dtOffDiag_gt_recursionOrder","kind":"theorem","line":160,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.lean#L160-L164","doc":"**The structural gap (per knot).** The imported DT off-diagonal count strictly\nexceeds the internally-derivable recursion order: `4₁`: `3 > 2`; `5₂`: `4 > 3`.\nEven the derivable structural integer under-determines the DT count. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.dtOffDiagMax_fiveTwo","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.dtOffDiagMax_fiveTwo","kind":"theorem","line":158,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.lean#L158-L158","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.dtOffDiagMax_fourOne","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.dtOffDiagMax_fourOne","kind":"theorem","line":157,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.lean#L157-L157","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.recursionOrder_fiveTwo","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.recursionOrder_fiveTwo","kind":"theorem","line":156,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.lean#L156-L156","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.recursionOrder_fourOne","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.recursionOrder_fourOne","kind":"theorem","line":155,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.lean#L155-L155","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.dtOffDiagMax","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.dtOffDiagMax","kind":"def","line":149,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.lean#L149-L153","doc":"**Imported DT / BPS off-diagonal count.** `4₁`: `3`; `5₂`: spectrum `{3,4}`,\nmaximal member `4`. Recorded to contrast with `recursionOrder`; not derived. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.recursionOrder","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.recursionOrder","kind":"def","line":141,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.lean#L141-L147","doc":"**Internally-derived structural integer.** The order of the QOU-owned AJ\nannihilator of `K` — equivalently the `L`-degree of `A_K`, equivalently the GGM\nStokes-matrix dimension. `4₁`: 2 (2nd-order annihilator, proved sorry-free);\n`5₂`: 3 (`3×3` blocks). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.instDecidableEqKKnot","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.instDecidableEqKKnot","kind":"instance","line":137,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.lean#L137-L137","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.KKnot.fiveTwo","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.KKnot.fiveTwo","kind":"ctor","line":136,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.lean#L136-L136","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.KKnot.fourOne","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.KKnot.fourOne","kind":"ctor","line":135,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.lean#L135-L135","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.KKnot","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.KKnot","kind":"inductive","line":133,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.lean#L133-L137","doc":"The two keystone knots: amphichiral `4₁` (muon anchor), chiral `5₂`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.euler_machinery_misses_dt_count","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.euler_machinery_misses_dt_count","kind":"theorem","line":123,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.lean#L123-L128","doc":"**The honest negative (Part 1).** The QOU Wedderburn/Springer Euler\ncharacteristic (`−2`, the sandwich *normalization*) does **not** equal the knot\nDT count (`3`, the *off-diagonal*): the Euler-char arithmetic does not close to\n`3`. So the bridge's first equality `Stokes = DT` for `4₁` is **not** produced by\nthe QOU Euler-characteristic machinery. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.dtCount_fourOne","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.dtCount_fourOne","kind":"def","line":119,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.lean#L119-L121","doc":"The imported knot DT / Stokes / BPS off-diagonal count of `4₁`: `S⁺(0)₀₁ = 3`\n(recorded, not derived). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.partitionEuler3_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.partitionEuler3_eq","kind":"theorem","line":115,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.lean#L115-L117","doc":"**What the QOU Euler-characteristic machinery actually produces: `−2`.**\n`Σ_{λ⊢3} Δ_λ = 1 − 2 − 1 = −2`. Decidable. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.partitionEuler3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.partitionEuler3","kind":"def","line":110,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.lean#L110-L113","doc":"**The total QOU Euler characteristic over the `H₃` Wedderburn blocks.**\n`Σ_{λ⊢3} (-1)^{n(λ)} dim V_λ`. This is the machinery the directive proposes for\nproducing the knot DT count. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.blockEuler","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.blockEuler","kind":"def","line":106,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.lean#L106-L108","doc":"Per-block DT / 3d-index Euler characteristic `(-1)^{n(λ)} · dim V_λ` (the\n`dtEulerG` collapse of `DeltaLambdaDTIndexGeneralN`, here evaluated on `H₃`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.h3Blocks","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.h3Blocks","kind":"def","line":99,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/StokesDTCountExceedsRecursionOrder.lean#L99-L104","doc":"The three Wedderburn blocks of `H₃(q)` (partitions `λ ⊢ 3`), each recorded as\nits `(a-function grade n(λ), Wedderburn dimension dim V_λ)`:\n`(3) ↦ (0,1)`, `(2,1) ↦ (1,2)`, `(1³) ↦ (3,1)`. These are QOU data (the\na-function is the Gröbner–Shirshov jet-order valuation; the dimension is the\n`H₃ → Wedderburn` block dimension). ","signatureChunk":0}]}